1
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:13,930
<font color="white">THE KING'S PROCESSION LEAVES</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">DONHWAMUN GATE</font><font color="white"></font></font>

2
00:00:14,014 --> 00:00:15,932
<font color="white">AND MAKES FOR HWASEONG</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:16,015 --> 00:00:17,934
<font color="white">DONHWAMUN GATE</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:18,017 --> 00:00:22,147
<font color="white">DONHWAMUN GATE</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:02:12,298 --> 00:02:14,425
<font color="white">May His Majesty</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">have remained in good health.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

6
00:02:24,769 --> 00:02:29,274
<font color="white">THE SCANDAL</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:02:32,235 --> 00:02:34,279
<font color="white">You said your farewells already,</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:02:34,362 --> 00:02:36,656
<font color="white">so why are you asking for</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your clothes now?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

9
00:02:42,453 --> 00:02:43,663
<font color="white">Good grief.</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:44,289 --> 00:02:46,082
<font color="white">Damn it!</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:46,916 --> 00:02:47,750
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:49,252 --> 00:02:50,128
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:50,712 --> 00:02:53,047
<font color="white">Head back to Hanyang first.</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:53,756 --> 00:02:55,800
<font color="white">Just me? Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:55,884 --> 00:02:57,385
<font color="white">You fool, do you think</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:58,386 --> 00:02:59,721
<font color="white">I came here for pleasure?</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:59,804 --> 00:03:00,680
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:03:01,598 --> 00:03:04,142
<font color="white">His Majesty ordered me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to inspect the construction site.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

19
00:03:05,351 --> 00:03:08,563
<font color="white">I wasted the entire day, so I am busy.</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,440
<font color="white">Off with you now.</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:13,151 --> 00:03:14,694
<font color="white">But I just got to see Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:23,745 --> 00:03:24,579
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:27,206 --> 00:03:28,207
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:33,963 --> 00:03:35,048
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:36,215 --> 00:03:37,717
<font color="white">I have brought your change of…</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:38,384 --> 00:03:39,469
<font color="white">clothes…</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:40,637 --> 00:03:41,596
<font color="white">Wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:41,679 --> 00:03:42,764
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:42,847 --> 00:03:46,267
<font color="white">When did you change?</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:47,268 --> 00:03:48,102
<font color="white">Oh, right.</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:48,728 --> 00:03:49,646
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:51,022 --> 00:03:51,856
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:53,358 --> 00:03:54,651
<font color="white">Where did you even</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:56,361 --> 00:03:58,821
<font color="white">find these clothes?</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:59,489 --> 00:04:00,323
<font color="white">You are</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:01,658 --> 00:04:02,659
<font color="white">remarkably quick.</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:05,536 --> 00:04:06,371
<font color="white">There.</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:20,885 --> 00:04:21,761
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:23,054 --> 00:04:23,930
<font color="white">Are you awake?</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:24,847 --> 00:04:26,015
<font color="white">May I come in?</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:33,690 --> 00:04:34,524
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:35,275 --> 00:04:36,234
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:41,155 --> 00:04:42,907
<font color="white"><i>Since my husband passed,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:43,658 --> 00:04:48,121
<font color="white"><i>I have lived bearing the shame and guilt</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>of not following after him at once.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:49,872 --> 00:04:51,916
<font color="white"><i>Now, it seems the time has come.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:53,042 --> 00:04:55,795
<font color="white"><i>I take my leave with the joy of knowing</i></font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:55,878 --> 00:04:58,214
<font color="white">-Is that true?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>-I shall see him again.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:58,298 --> 00:04:59,132
<font color="white">Hui-yeon!</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:59,632 --> 00:05:00,758
<font color="white"><i>Farewell.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:05:01,301 --> 00:05:02,302
<font color="white">Hui-yeon!</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:09,392 --> 00:05:13,646
<font color="white">It seems Hui-yeon came to see</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">her brother one last time</font><font color="white"></font></font>

52
00:05:14,605 --> 00:05:16,232
<font color="white">before taking her leave of this world.</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:20,069 --> 00:05:23,114
<font color="white">Listen. Search every well in the village,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the lower reaches of the river,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

54
00:05:23,906 --> 00:05:26,326
<font color="white">and every mountain</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">within ten </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>li</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> if you must.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

55
00:05:28,745 --> 00:05:30,872
<font color="white">Bring me Hui-yeon's body.</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:05:30,955 --> 00:05:31,831
<font color="white">-Yes, sir.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

57
00:05:33,666 --> 00:05:37,211
<font color="white">And you, Eun-sil,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">go to the Left State Councilor at once</font><font color="white"></font></font>

58
00:05:37,295 --> 00:05:40,131
<font color="white">and inform him of Hui-yeon's noble death.</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:40,214 --> 00:05:41,424
<font color="white">Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:59,067 --> 00:05:59,901
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:00,485 --> 00:06:02,570
<font color="white">Yes, tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:02,653 --> 00:06:04,655
<font color="white">The truth is, when I was there that day,</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:06:05,239 --> 00:06:08,159
<font color="white">I was taught</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that taking one's own life is a sin.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

64
00:06:08,951 --> 00:06:11,579
<font color="white">The Lord forbids</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the harming of human life,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

65
00:06:13,331 --> 00:06:15,291
<font color="white">so surely taking one's own life</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is no different.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

66
00:06:18,503 --> 00:06:20,797
<font color="white">I felt I had come to know</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">something I ought not know,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

67
00:06:22,715 --> 00:06:23,966
<font color="white">and I was afraid.</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:33,559
<font color="white">And then, of all places,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I encountered you there.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

69
00:06:35,019 --> 00:06:37,105
<font color="white">On the day you came to know</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what ought not be known,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

70
00:06:38,272 --> 00:06:40,358
<font color="white">you met the person you ought not have met.</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:49,867
<font color="white">And yet…</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:52,537 --> 00:06:54,288
<font color="white">my heart longs for you, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:15,393 --> 00:07:16,227
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:17,854 --> 00:07:19,647
<font color="white">Good to see you back.</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:07:20,314 --> 00:07:21,315
<font color="white">It has been some time.</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:21,899 --> 00:07:23,067
<font color="white">I hope you have been well.</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:23,901 --> 00:07:24,902
<font color="white">Yes, well then.</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:07:46,466 --> 00:07:48,009
<font color="white">Young master!</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:48,092 --> 00:07:50,303
<font color="white">Goodness! Young master!</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:51,262 --> 00:07:52,388
<font color="white">Have you been well?</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:52,472 --> 00:07:53,389
<font color="white">Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:54,599 --> 00:07:56,100
<font color="white">I shall stay in the outer room,</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:57,518 --> 00:07:59,228
<font color="white">so give this fellow my room.</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:08:00,855 --> 00:08:02,190
<font color="white">Young master,</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:08:02,273 --> 00:08:04,817
<font color="white">are you telling me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to give a room to a servant?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

86
00:08:04,901 --> 00:08:05,985
<font color="white">He is no servant.</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:08:06,944 --> 00:08:09,322
<font color="white">There are circumstances, so hurry now.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:08:13,284 --> 00:08:14,452
<font color="white">Follow me, then.</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:08:33,137 --> 00:08:35,223
<font color="white"><i>"After reading the letter</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>hidden in the tobacco box,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:08:35,306 --> 00:08:37,558
<font color="white"><i>I fell utterly for your manly charm,"</i></font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:08:38,059 --> 00:08:39,644
<font color="white"><i>the young widow said.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:08:44,774 --> 00:08:45,608
<font color="white"><i>Dear cousin</i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

93
00:08:46,275 --> 00:08:47,652
<font color="white"><i>She is all but ready to yield.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:08:48,277 --> 00:08:50,154
<font color="white"><i>Her undergarments</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>are practically in my grasp.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:08:54,742 --> 00:08:56,702
<font color="white">What a lovely aroma.</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:11,634
<font color="white">Please wait here a moment.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I shall fetch the young madam.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

97
00:09:11,717 --> 00:09:12,552
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:09:51,465 --> 00:09:53,718
<font color="white">"In filial piety</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:09:54,468 --> 00:09:57,221
<font color="white">and brotherly devotion</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">lies the root of benevolence."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

100
00:09:58,055 --> 00:09:59,932
<font color="white"><i>"Fine words</i></font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:10:01,434 --> 00:10:03,060
<font color="white"><i>and an insinuating appearance are</i></font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:10:04,687 --> 00:10:05,938
<font color="white"><i>seldom associated with virtue."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:10:08,482 --> 00:10:09,483
<font color="white">A concubine?</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:10:12,612 --> 00:10:13,613
<font color="white">How can she be…</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:10:26,542 --> 00:10:27,710
<font color="white">What lousy handwriting.</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:10:28,628 --> 00:10:29,503
<font color="white">That wretched girl.</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:10:35,259 --> 00:10:37,178
<font color="white">I should have been the one to come here.</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:10:42,224 --> 00:10:43,643
<font color="white">She broke this?</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:10:44,352 --> 00:10:45,311
<font color="white">She's out of her mind!</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:11:00,701 --> 00:11:04,080
<font color="white">TO YOUNG MASTER</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:11,504
<font color="white">Mother!</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:14,965
<font color="white">Yes, you are back.</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:17,968
<font color="white">Did you find anything?</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:11:19,762 --> 00:11:21,055
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:11:21,138 --> 00:11:23,224
<font color="white">I found this in So-ok's room.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:11:24,767 --> 00:11:25,976
<font color="white">You read it.</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,604
<font color="white">I am too drowsy to read it myself.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:11:39,115 --> 00:11:40,324
<font color="white">"Young master,</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:11:40,408 --> 00:11:42,201
<font color="white">you may not believe me,</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:11:42,701 --> 00:11:45,413
<font color="white">but thoughts of you leave me breathless,</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:11:46,705 --> 00:11:50,126
<font color="white">and I spent the night</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">thoroughly drenched."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

122
00:11:52,253 --> 00:11:53,087
<font color="white">"My…</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:11:53,838 --> 00:11:55,756
<font color="white">thighs seem to part of their own accord,</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:11:56,549 --> 00:11:58,884
<font color="white">yet there are no great hands</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to spread them further."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

125
00:11:59,468 --> 00:12:01,137
<font color="white">"I long for you, young master."</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:12:06,851 --> 00:12:08,144
<font color="white">Leave us now.</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:12:09,311 --> 00:12:11,313
<font color="white">Leave at once. Quickly!</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:12:19,572 --> 00:12:20,739
<font color="white">What on earth?</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:12:23,033 --> 00:12:24,243
<font color="white">You…</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:12:24,326 --> 00:12:26,454
<font color="white">You really found this in So-ok's room?</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:12:26,537 --> 00:12:27,746
<font color="white">Yes, Mother.</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:12:29,415 --> 00:12:31,792
<font color="white">But why would she… Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:12:34,128 --> 00:12:35,171
<font color="white">"Young master."</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:12:36,464 --> 00:12:37,798
<font color="white">"Young master"?</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:12:40,009 --> 00:12:41,427
<font color="white">That little vixen.</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:12:42,386 --> 00:12:46,348
<font color="white">That must be what she calls the minister</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when she dallies with him in private.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

137
00:12:46,432 --> 00:12:47,391
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:12:47,475 --> 00:12:48,893
<font color="white">Surely not.</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:12:48,976 --> 00:12:50,269
<font color="white">What do you mean, surely not?</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:12:50,811 --> 00:12:52,188
<font color="white">Then what?</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:12:52,271 --> 00:12:54,231
<font color="white">Are you saying my So-ok…</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:13:00,571 --> 00:13:02,281
<font color="white">-No…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Mother!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

143
00:13:02,781 --> 00:13:07,161
<font color="white">I sent her there</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to become a concubine, and instead…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

144
00:13:26,722 --> 00:13:27,806
<font color="white">Are you heading out?</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:27,890 --> 00:13:30,100
<font color="white">I am off to see my brother-in-law</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at Janganmun Gate.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

146
00:13:31,268 --> 00:13:33,437
<font color="white">See to him well, would you?</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:13:34,021 --> 00:13:36,273
<font color="white">He must be quite weary</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the long journey.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

148
00:13:36,357 --> 00:13:39,443
<font color="white">You are the only one I can trust.</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:13:39,527 --> 00:13:40,569
<font color="white">Of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:13:44,323 --> 00:13:45,699
<font color="white">Safe travels, sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:13:46,742 --> 00:13:48,577
<font color="white"><i>Everything written in my prior letter was…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:13:48,661 --> 00:13:50,955
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>falsehood and jest.</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-"Everything was falsehood and jest"?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

153
00:13:51,664 --> 00:13:52,790
<font color="white">"Everything was falsehood…"</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:13:52,873 --> 00:13:56,669
<font color="white"><i>Remembering the feelings</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>I once held for Lord Cho Won,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:13:56,752 --> 00:13:58,671
<font color="white"><i>I merely teased him for amusement.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:13:59,672 --> 00:14:00,923
<font color="white"><i>So I pray</i></font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:14:01,757 --> 00:14:03,008
<font color="white"><i>you laugh my letter off.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:14:03,926 --> 00:14:05,719
<font color="white"><i>Do not trouble your heart over it,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:14:05,803 --> 00:14:08,639
<font color="white"><i>and I beg your generous forgiveness.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:14:10,975 --> 00:14:13,269
<font color="white">"Everything was falsehood and jest"?</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:14:15,980 --> 00:14:17,439
<font color="white">"Feelings I once held"?</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:14:27,199 --> 00:14:30,619
<font color="white">The banquet requires</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a great many hands, all right?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

163
00:14:30,703 --> 00:14:32,288
<font color="white">Men shall be sent from the palace,</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:14:32,371 --> 00:14:34,915
<font color="white">but there is much</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to be prepared here beforehand.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

165
00:14:34,999 --> 00:14:36,709
<font color="white">I understand your concern,</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:14:36,792 --> 00:14:39,628
<font color="white">but the construction is proceeding</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">faster than expected.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

167
00:14:39,712 --> 00:14:41,672
<font color="white">With things going so smoothly,</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:14:41,755 --> 00:14:44,049
<font color="white">if we start pulling men away</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to other duties,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

169
00:14:44,133 --> 00:14:46,176
<font color="white">people will surely talk.</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:47,803
<font color="white">We cannot allow that.</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:14:47,887 --> 00:14:50,264
<font color="white">Which is precisely why</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">we must find another way.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

172
00:14:54,184 --> 00:14:58,105
<font color="white">I say this only because I truly wish</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to see this matter carried through well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

173
00:15:00,357 --> 00:15:01,567
<font color="white">Come here, all of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:15:02,568 --> 00:15:04,069
<font color="white">Well, we are finally…</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:15:04,153 --> 00:15:04,987
<font color="white">Brother.</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:15:06,697 --> 00:15:09,950
<font color="white">You seem rather occupied,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I shall leave you to it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

177
00:15:12,369 --> 00:15:13,662
<font color="white">My apologies.</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:15:14,705 --> 00:15:17,374
<font color="white">The matter is of such importance</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that there is much to settle.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

179
00:15:19,335 --> 00:15:20,669
<font color="white">Come by my quarters sometime.</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:15:22,171 --> 00:15:26,133
<font color="white">Let us sit together and speak ill</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of your cousin for once in her absence.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

181
00:15:27,092 --> 00:15:28,052
<font color="white">Very well.</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:15:39,730 --> 00:15:42,107
<font color="white">Thanks to you, we were able</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to supply paper again as before.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

183
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:44,652
<font color="white">I hardly know how to repay such a favor.</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:15:46,403 --> 00:15:47,279
<font color="white">It is no favor.</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:15:47,905 --> 00:15:48,739
<font color="white">It is simply</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:15:49,615 --> 00:15:51,200
<font color="white">His Majesty's benevolence</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:15:53,118 --> 00:15:55,120
<font color="white">spreading throughout Hwaseong.</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:15:58,707 --> 00:16:00,834
<font color="white">What are you doing? Make haste!</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:16:01,835 --> 00:16:03,754
<font color="white">Pull harder. That's it.</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:16:34,618 --> 00:16:35,869
<font color="white">My lady, it is I.</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:16:37,121 --> 00:16:38,372
<font color="white">May I come in?</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:17:00,436 --> 00:17:01,478
<font color="white">Have you been crying?</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:17:04,606 --> 00:17:05,649
<font color="white">Do you regret it?</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:17:06,483 --> 00:17:09,695
<font color="white">It was my own choice. I have no regrets.</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:17:09,778 --> 00:17:10,988
<font color="white">Then what troubles you?</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:17:14,616 --> 00:17:17,453
<font color="white">It says everything was falsehood and jest.</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:17:18,454 --> 00:17:20,414
<font color="white">I did feel something was amiss,</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:17:21,123 --> 00:17:22,833
<font color="white">but if you</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:17:24,334 --> 00:17:25,878
<font color="white">have merely been toying with me…</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:17:29,548 --> 00:17:32,509
<font color="white">-If that is the truth--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-In my haste to bring you away,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

201
00:17:32,593 --> 00:17:35,512
<font color="white">the matter of this letter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">entirely slipped my mind.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

202
00:17:36,472 --> 00:17:39,933
<font color="white">You should have told me sooner</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">instead of troubling your heart over it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

203
00:17:41,935 --> 00:17:43,937
<font color="white">You saw the earlier letter as well,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">did you not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

204
00:17:49,109 --> 00:17:50,903
<font color="white">There was another?</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:17:51,695 --> 00:17:52,529
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:18:05,834 --> 00:18:08,462
<font color="white"><i>So you did not deliver that letter</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to the widow after all.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:13,842
<font color="white"><i>Your thoughtful resolve to hand me</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>the widow and grant me my reward at last</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:18:14,468 --> 00:18:15,677
<font color="white"><i>nearly moved me to tears.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:18:21,725 --> 00:18:23,185
<font color="white">Now that matters have come to this,</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:18:23,769 --> 00:18:26,230
<font color="white">I must begin with the first letter.</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:18:28,649 --> 00:18:30,859
<font color="white">This shall be a somewhat lengthy tale,</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:18:31,443 --> 00:18:35,447
<font color="white">so I beg you steel yourself well.</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:18:41,036 --> 00:18:44,456
<font color="white">There was a time when I traveled around</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the country writing on tobacco.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

214
00:18:47,709 --> 00:18:49,962
<font color="white">I came to know a woman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who dealt in tobacco,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

215
00:18:50,045 --> 00:18:52,256
<font color="white">and as she was knowledgeable</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in such matters,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

216
00:18:53,507 --> 00:18:55,634
<font color="white">she offered to assist me in my writings.</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:18:57,845 --> 00:19:01,014
<font color="white">Whenever the flavor of tobacco</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">clouded my senses,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

218
00:19:01,807 --> 00:19:04,685
<font color="white">that woman made no effort</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to conceal her lewd desires toward me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

219
00:19:04,768 --> 00:19:06,061
<font color="white">One day, she went so far as…</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:19:09,189 --> 00:19:10,899
<font color="white">to beg for my love.</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:19:14,736 --> 00:19:18,073
<font color="white">Wishing to prove myself a man,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I put on a show of reckless bravado.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

222
00:19:20,576 --> 00:19:22,494
<font color="white">In the end,</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:19:23,370 --> 00:19:26,248
<font color="white">I indulged in that woman's lewdness.</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:45,601
<font color="white">However…</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:19:48,312 --> 00:19:52,191
<font color="white">just as the blazing heat of midsummer</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">flees before the crimson leaves of autumn,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

226
00:19:53,317 --> 00:19:55,736
<font color="white">my wandering too came to an end.</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:19:55,819 --> 00:19:57,196
<font color="white">I believed that brief affair</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:19:57,696 --> 00:20:00,032
<font color="white">had vanished</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before it could become a scandal.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

229
00:20:00,908 --> 00:20:01,867
<font color="white">And yet,</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:20:03,035 --> 00:20:06,079
<font color="white">not long ago, she somehow discovered</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">where I was and sent me a letter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

231
00:20:10,042 --> 00:20:12,502
<font color="white">She wrote of her lingering desire for me…</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:20:15,047 --> 00:20:18,091
<font color="white">in the filthiest and most obscene words.</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:20:21,678 --> 00:20:22,930
<font color="white">I had no intention of replying.</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:20:24,306 --> 00:20:26,600
<font color="white">I meant to cast it straight into the fire.</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:20:26,683 --> 00:20:28,060
<font color="white">But through my own carelessness,</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:20:28,143 --> 00:20:31,021
<font color="white">I feared it had been sent to you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">among my own letter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

237
00:20:34,233 --> 00:20:35,943
<font color="white">I was deeply ashamed.</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:20:36,985 --> 00:20:40,030
<font color="white">I could think of no remedy.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I was at a complete loss.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

239
00:20:40,113 --> 00:20:42,366
<font color="white">So in the end, I sought the woman out</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:20:43,242 --> 00:20:45,619
<font color="white">and pleaded with her</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to write that everything in the letter</font><font color="white"></font></font>

241
00:20:46,286 --> 00:20:47,621
<font color="white">had been falsehood and jest.</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:20:47,704 --> 00:20:48,997
<font color="white">I clung to her</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:20:49,581 --> 00:20:51,083
<font color="white">and begged for it.</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:20:53,877 --> 00:20:55,420
<font color="white">How could you do that to such a woman?</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:20:55,504 --> 00:20:57,422
<font color="white">Because my affection for you…</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:21:03,428 --> 00:21:04,846
<font color="white">is more sincere</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:21:06,223 --> 00:21:08,016
<font color="white">than any feeling I have ever held</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:21:08,517 --> 00:21:10,185
<font color="white">for anyone else in my life.</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:21:18,235 --> 00:21:19,569
<font color="white">That is enough.</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:21:22,030 --> 00:21:24,074
<font color="white">You have laid everything bare before me…</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:21:27,494 --> 00:21:30,289
<font color="white">so I shall fill the void in your heart.</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:21:41,550 --> 00:21:43,552
<font color="white">This wretched past of mine…</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:21:45,262 --> 00:21:49,975
<font color="white">Those shameful days</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that have torn your heart to pieces…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

254
00:21:54,062 --> 00:21:57,733
<font color="white">No, how am I to show you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">this desire I have</font><font color="white"></font></font>

255
00:21:58,734 --> 00:22:01,361
<font color="white">to punish myself for it all?</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:22:31,767 --> 00:22:33,351
<font color="white">It is all right.</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:22:44,071 --> 00:22:45,530
<font color="white">Thank you, my lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:22:49,076 --> 00:22:50,368
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:22:51,328 --> 00:22:55,791
<font color="white">Whatever am I to do</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:22:56,374 --> 00:23:00,504
<font color="white">with this miserable past of mine?</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:23:09,304 --> 00:23:11,264
<font color="white">How shall I ever</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:23:13,266 --> 00:23:16,311
<font color="white">earn your forgiveness</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:23:17,145 --> 00:23:20,982
<font color="white">for those shameful days…</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:23:21,942 --> 00:23:25,070
<font color="white"><i>When I offered the widow some flowers,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>she faintly smiled.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:23:26,279 --> 00:23:29,282
<font color="white"><i>She learned how to make </i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">hwajeon</font><font color="white"></font>
<font color="white"><i>from Mrs. Asan and made some herself.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:23:30,575 --> 00:23:33,954
<font color="white"><i>She said the scent of flowers may fade,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>yet their taste lingers in the heart.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:23:35,163 --> 00:23:36,248
<font color="white"><i>And told me</i></font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:23:37,165 --> 00:23:39,376
<font color="white"><i>to gather flowers for her again</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>this time next year.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:23:40,418 --> 00:23:41,503
<font color="white">Look at that.</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:23:42,546 --> 00:23:43,588
<font color="white">She speaks of spring?</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:23:45,340 --> 00:23:48,927
<font color="white">She means to live until the new spring,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when the streams thaw and run free again?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

272
00:23:53,140 --> 00:23:54,224
<font color="white">Dear me.</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:23:55,684 --> 00:23:58,019
<font color="white">So she does not wish to die.</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:24:00,814 --> 00:24:02,524
<font color="white">She wishes to live.</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:24:05,527 --> 00:24:08,363
<font color="white">That widow has found the will to live.</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:24:38,768 --> 00:24:40,270
<font color="white">She came back alone?</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:24:48,653 --> 00:24:50,238
<font color="white">-What happened?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-My lady.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

278
00:24:52,032 --> 00:24:53,033
<font color="white">The young madam</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:24:53,992 --> 00:24:56,620
<font color="white">has left this world in the end.</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:25:11,885 --> 00:25:12,719
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:25:14,012 --> 00:25:16,765
<font color="white">Is something troubling your mind?</font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:25:16,848 --> 00:25:18,558
<font color="white">Why do you ask such a thing?</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:25:18,642 --> 00:25:22,562
<font color="white">The flowers in your painting seem angry.</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:25:25,690 --> 00:25:29,444
<font color="white">I wonder whether you get that wit</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from your mother or your father.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

285
00:25:31,112 --> 00:25:33,031
<font color="white">Madam, it is Gye-hwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:25:33,114 --> 00:25:34,824
<font color="white">I have something urgent to tell you.</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:25:39,871 --> 00:25:42,791
<font color="white">The Left State Councilor's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daughter-in-law's servant has returned.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

288
00:25:42,874 --> 00:25:44,125
<font color="white">However,</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:25:44,209 --> 00:25:45,460
<font color="white">she came back alone.</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:25:48,463 --> 00:25:49,798
<font color="white">Of course she did.</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:25:52,092 --> 00:25:55,136
<font color="white">At first light tomorrow,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I shall visit the Lady of the First Rank.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

292
00:25:55,762 --> 00:25:57,305
<font color="white">Yes, I shall make the preparations.</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:26:04,104 --> 00:26:05,522
<font color="white">All right, let us go.</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:26:08,775 --> 00:26:10,986
<font color="white">You look quite unwell.</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:26:11,987 --> 00:26:13,571
<font color="white">Do I?</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:26:14,155 --> 00:26:15,031
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:26:16,074 --> 00:26:19,244
<font color="white">Word has come</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from my daughter-in-law's family home.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

298
00:26:21,329 --> 00:26:22,372
<font color="white">It seems</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:26:24,082 --> 00:26:27,043
<font color="white">the poor girl met her end there.</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:26:30,714 --> 00:26:31,548
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:26:32,882 --> 00:26:36,720
<font color="white">You mean your daughter-in-law</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has passed away?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

302
00:26:37,971 --> 00:26:41,391
<font color="white">I suppose</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">there is some comfort in thinking</font><font color="white"></font></font>

303
00:26:42,767 --> 00:26:44,853
<font color="white">my Geum-ho shall no longer be alone.</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:26:46,062 --> 00:26:46,896
<font color="white">Yet</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:26:48,148 --> 00:26:51,151
<font color="white">there is no telling</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">whether she threw herself into the river</font><font color="white"></font></font>

306
00:26:51,735 --> 00:26:53,653
<font color="white">or cast herself into a well.</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:26:56,781 --> 00:27:00,035
<font color="white">They have not yet found her body.</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:27:01,870 --> 00:27:02,912
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:27:02,996 --> 00:27:05,290
<font color="white">I cannot begin</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:27:06,416 --> 00:27:08,501
<font color="white">to imagine your sorrow.</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:27:09,836 --> 00:27:12,505
<font color="white">I, who shared a friendship with her,</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:27:13,131 --> 00:27:16,134
<font color="white">am overcome with grief as well.</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:27:17,719 --> 00:27:21,973
<font color="white">I cannot fathom how painful</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">this loss must be for your family.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

314
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:33,234
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:27:34,944 --> 00:27:35,820
<font color="white">Lady Cho.</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:27:37,030 --> 00:27:38,531
<font color="white">Though I am ashamed to ask,</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:27:39,616 --> 00:27:41,951
<font color="white">may I beg a favor of you?</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:27:42,035 --> 00:27:44,245
<font color="white">Yes, of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:27:44,788 --> 00:27:45,997
<font color="white">Do tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:27:46,081 --> 00:27:48,625
<font color="white">We would not wish for rumors</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to begin spreading.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

321
00:27:49,751 --> 00:27:51,920
<font color="white">Would it be possible</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:27:52,796 --> 00:27:56,132
<font color="white">for a virtuous lady such as yourself</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to submit a petition to His Majesty?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

323
00:27:59,260 --> 00:28:00,095
<font color="white">You wish me--</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:28:00,178 --> 00:28:03,932
<font color="white">Could you not do that for me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with Lord Yoo's assistance?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

325
00:28:15,527 --> 00:28:16,611
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:28:17,529 --> 00:28:19,197
<font color="white">I shall do so.</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:28:40,301 --> 00:28:42,887
<font color="white">"Would it be possible</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:28:42,971 --> 00:28:46,641
<font color="white">for a virtuous lady such as yourself</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to submit a petition to His Majesty?"</font><font color="white"></font></font>

329
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:51,354
<font color="white">"Lady Cho?"</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:28:56,025 --> 00:28:58,445
<font color="white">To think she would come</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">begging favors of me now.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

331
00:29:10,248 --> 00:29:11,750
<font color="white">-So-ok.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes, my lady.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

332
00:29:12,459 --> 00:29:14,002
<font color="white">I shall not be long.</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:29:14,085 --> 00:29:16,421
<font color="white">Do not stir up trouble</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and give people cause to talk.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

334
00:29:16,504 --> 00:29:19,007
<font color="white">Yes, my lady. Safe travels.</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:29:20,467 --> 00:29:22,051
<font color="white">All right, up now.</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:29:24,095 --> 00:29:24,929
<font color="white">Let us go.</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:29:28,391 --> 00:29:30,018
<font color="white">All right, make haste.</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:29:30,602 --> 00:29:32,270
<font color="white">We must finish before nightfall.</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:29:32,854 --> 00:29:33,938
<font color="white">A letter for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:29:39,360 --> 00:29:40,904
<font color="white"><i>There is something I must tell you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:29:41,404 --> 00:29:42,989
<font color="white"><i>Please, you must come.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:29:44,783 --> 00:29:46,785
<font color="white"><i>I shall wait all night at the study annex.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:29:51,706 --> 00:29:52,665
<font color="white">Oh, my goodness!</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:29:52,749 --> 00:29:54,584
<font color="white">Wait, who are you?</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:29:54,667 --> 00:29:56,503
<font color="white">-Quiet now!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Mom?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

346
00:29:58,963 --> 00:30:01,090
<font color="white">Come here! Come!</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:30:02,550 --> 00:30:04,469
<font color="white">Oh, for heaven's sake.</font><font color="white"></font>

348
00:30:08,181 --> 00:30:11,100
<font color="white">You meant to give this love letter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to that young master?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

349
00:30:12,018 --> 00:30:13,269
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:30:13,353 --> 00:30:14,813
<font color="white">Have you gone insane?</font><font color="white"></font>

351
00:30:14,896 --> 00:30:16,272
<font color="white">Come now!</font><font color="white"></font>

352
00:30:16,356 --> 00:30:19,234
<font color="white">Even the madam gave her permission,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so why are you hitting me?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

353
00:30:19,317 --> 00:30:22,320
<font color="white">Do you know anything</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">about the lives of women in Bukchon?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

354
00:30:22,403 --> 00:30:23,905
<font color="white">What did you just say?</font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:30:24,614 --> 00:30:25,949
<font color="white">Who gave permission?</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:30:26,032 --> 00:30:27,242
<font color="white">The madam?</font><font color="white"></font>

357
00:30:28,910 --> 00:30:30,328
<font color="white">The… The madam?</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:30:31,746 --> 00:30:35,416
<font color="white">So the mistress of this house</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">knows of it all as well?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

359
00:30:35,500 --> 00:30:36,876
<font color="white">That's right, Mother.</font><font color="white"></font>

360
00:30:37,627 --> 00:30:40,296
<font color="white">She said it was all right.</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:30:40,380 --> 00:30:43,591
<font color="white">In fact, she even encouraged me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to seek Lord Cho Won's help,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

362
00:30:43,675 --> 00:30:47,178
<font color="white">saying it would benefit me.</font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:30:47,262 --> 00:30:49,681
<font color="white">Can you not tell at a glance?</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:30:49,764 --> 00:30:51,683
<font color="white">Those are not words</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I could have written myself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

365
00:30:53,059 --> 00:30:54,185
<font color="white">Cho Won?</font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:30:55,103 --> 00:30:59,065
<font color="white">I know well enough</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what worries you, Mother.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

367
00:30:59,691 --> 00:31:01,901
<font color="white">But you need not fret.</font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:31:02,569 --> 00:31:06,072
<font color="white">Neither the madam</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">nor the servants of this house</font><font color="white"></font></font>

369
00:31:06,823 --> 00:31:09,701
<font color="white">treat me as nothing more than</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a womb to bear children.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

370
00:31:11,077 --> 00:31:13,204
<font color="white">Mother, are you even listening to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

371
00:31:13,288 --> 00:31:14,330
<font color="white">Be quiet, you fool.</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:31:18,835 --> 00:31:23,214
<font color="white">So you wrote this letter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">together with Lord Cho Won?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

373
00:31:24,048 --> 00:31:25,300
<font color="white">That is what I said.</font><font color="white"></font>

374
00:31:28,678 --> 00:31:32,432
<font color="white">Do you happen to know him as well?</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:31:32,515 --> 00:31:35,268
<font color="white">So-ok, tell me the truth.</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:31:37,312 --> 00:31:39,898
<font color="white">Aside from writing the letter,</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:31:40,523 --> 00:31:43,651
<font color="white">did anything else happen</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">between the two of you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

378
00:31:45,236 --> 00:31:47,030
<font color="white">What else would there have been?</font><font color="white"></font>

379
00:31:47,655 --> 00:31:50,450
<font color="white">Truly nothing else happened?</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:31:51,075 --> 00:31:52,493
<font color="white">I told you, no!</font><font color="white"></font>

381
00:32:09,636 --> 00:32:13,890
<font color="white">Then I suppose you never saw</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the tiger-shaped birthmark upon his chest.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

382
00:32:16,351 --> 00:32:17,518
<font color="white">He had such a thing?</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:32:18,394 --> 00:32:20,647
<font color="white">Confound it!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I was the only one stripped bare.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

384
00:32:20,730 --> 00:32:22,982
<font color="white">He never even undressed, so I saw nothing.</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:32:23,066 --> 00:32:24,108
<font color="white">You little…</font><font color="white"></font>

386
00:32:31,616 --> 00:32:34,243
<font color="white">Now that I think of it,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I never took off my underclothes…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

387
00:32:34,786 --> 00:32:36,746
<font color="white">Oh, you…</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:32:38,748 --> 00:32:40,041
<font color="white">Oh, that's right!</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:32:41,292 --> 00:32:42,418
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:32:42,502 --> 00:32:44,462
<font color="white">What now? Is there more?</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:32:45,672 --> 00:32:46,673
<font color="white">You darn little…</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:32:47,382 --> 00:32:48,466
<font color="white">Not that!</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:32:48,549 --> 00:32:50,385
<font color="white">I was in the madam's quarters.</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:55,807
<font color="white">I just remembered</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">something I overheard there.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

395
00:32:57,100 --> 00:32:58,851
<font color="white">They were speaking in secret</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:32:58,935 --> 00:33:01,938
<font color="white">of how the Left State Councilor's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daughter-in-law's maid returned alone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

397
00:33:03,481 --> 00:33:05,566
<font color="white">Well, I do not know the truth of it,</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:33:06,317 --> 00:33:08,611
<font color="white">but I heard the maids here whispering.</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:33:09,320 --> 00:33:12,115
<font color="white">They said the daughter-in-law</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">was as good as waiting for death,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

400
00:33:12,198 --> 00:33:14,409
<font color="white">so she might have fled</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the middle of the night.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

401
00:33:23,459 --> 00:33:25,128
<font color="white">Fled in the middle of the night?</font><font color="white"></font>

402
00:33:28,464 --> 00:33:29,298
<font color="white">Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:33:32,343 --> 00:33:33,177
<font color="white">Go on.</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:33:36,931 --> 00:33:39,600
<font color="white">I know you grieve</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for the young lady you served,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

405
00:33:39,684 --> 00:33:40,727
<font color="white">but that is enough.</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:33:47,567 --> 00:33:50,611
<font color="white">This brings great honor upon this family.</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:33:51,404 --> 00:33:54,657
<font color="white">So if you keep weeping like this,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you shall only earn their displeasure.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

408
00:33:54,741 --> 00:33:56,451
<font color="white">What will happen to me now?</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:33:59,037 --> 00:34:00,621
<font color="white">Now that my lady is gone,</font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:34:00,705 --> 00:34:03,624
<font color="white">they will treat me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">worse than a dog, will they not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

411
00:34:06,711 --> 00:34:07,879
<font color="white">How should I know?</font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:34:09,172 --> 00:34:11,799
<font color="white">That is why I am telling you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to stop your crying.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

413
00:34:14,218 --> 00:34:16,596
<font color="white">And go outside the main gate.</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:34:18,931 --> 00:34:20,808
<font color="white">What's his name, Chil-seong or something?</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:34:21,392 --> 00:34:23,811
<font color="white">The servant of that lord</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who was staying here waits for you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

416
00:34:23,895 --> 00:34:25,521
<font color="white">I nearly drove him off,</font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:34:26,272 --> 00:34:27,815
<font color="white">but I felt too bad for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,693
<font color="white">Did you say Chil-seong?</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:34:30,777 --> 00:34:31,652
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:34:45,083 --> 00:34:46,292
<font color="white">Are you all right?</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:34:46,375 --> 00:34:48,169
<font color="white">Good heavens, your face has grown so thin.</font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:34:55,093 --> 00:34:56,177
<font color="white">I heard</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:34:57,553 --> 00:34:59,347
<font color="white">that your lady has passed away.</font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:35:01,682 --> 00:35:04,060
<font color="white">This is beef. Dried beef.</font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:35:05,061 --> 00:35:06,145
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

426
00:35:08,898 --> 00:35:10,775
<font color="white">Even if grief has turned</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your mouth bitter,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

427
00:35:11,442 --> 00:35:12,610
<font color="white">you still must eat well.</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:35:12,693 --> 00:35:14,153
<font color="white">The living must go on living.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:35:16,072 --> 00:35:17,532
<font color="white">It took some effort to get this,</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:35:18,157 --> 00:35:19,283
<font color="white">so savor it.</font><font color="white"></font>

431
00:36:16,465 --> 00:36:17,758
<font color="white">Young master!</font><font color="white"></font>

432
00:36:17,842 --> 00:36:20,052
<font color="white">Young master, you have a visitor.</font><font color="white"></font>

433
00:36:29,103 --> 00:36:31,731
<font color="white">You came all this way</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">without so much as a word?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

434
00:36:33,232 --> 00:36:34,150
<font color="white">Have you perhaps</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:36:36,027 --> 00:36:38,905
<font color="white">come to grant me my reward in person?</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:36:39,530 --> 00:36:41,115
<font color="white">There is something I must tell you.</font><font color="white"></font>

437
00:36:49,582 --> 00:36:50,750
<font color="white">Dear cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

438
00:36:52,168 --> 00:36:53,252
<font color="white">Do tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

439
00:36:56,047 --> 00:37:00,092
<font color="white">In Bukchon,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">they believe the widow is dead.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

440
00:37:00,676 --> 00:37:01,636
<font color="white">I would imagine so.</font><font color="white"></font>

441
00:37:03,304 --> 00:37:06,641
<font color="white">And that is now tightening the noose</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">around both our necks.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

442
00:37:09,352 --> 00:37:10,478
<font color="white">Well now.</font><font color="white"></font>

443
00:37:11,896 --> 00:37:12,980
<font color="white">How interesting.</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:37:13,064 --> 00:37:14,273
<font color="white">Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:37:15,149 --> 00:37:16,484
<font color="white">We must stop now.</font><font color="white"></font>

446
00:37:17,151 --> 00:37:18,611
<font color="white">None of this can have happened.</font><font color="white"></font>

447
00:37:20,071 --> 00:37:21,072
<font color="white">Don't tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

448
00:37:23,866 --> 00:37:25,952
<font color="white">Do you mean to withdraw our wager now?</font><font color="white"></font>

449
00:37:27,578 --> 00:37:28,412
<font color="white">Come now.</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:37:29,538 --> 00:37:31,457
<font color="white">What an absurd thing to say.</font><font color="white"></font>

451
00:37:32,583 --> 00:37:33,960
<font color="white">If this continues,</font><font color="white"></font>

452
00:37:34,043 --> 00:37:38,130
<font color="white">your honor and our family's standing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">may be dragged through the mud!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

453
00:37:40,424 --> 00:37:41,425
<font color="white">My honor, did you say?</font><font color="white"></font>

454
00:37:42,718 --> 00:37:43,636
<font color="white">Did you?</font><font color="white"></font>

455
00:37:44,553 --> 00:37:45,763
<font color="white">My honor?</font><font color="white"></font>

456
00:37:48,599 --> 00:37:52,770
<font color="white">Do you truly claim</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to worry for my honor now?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

457
00:37:54,397 --> 00:37:56,190
<font color="white">Since the day we became literary friends,</font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:37:57,984 --> 00:37:59,944
<font color="white">I have always followed your wishes.</font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:38:00,820 --> 00:38:03,406
<font color="white">As time passed,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I vowed I would no longer do so.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

460
00:38:03,489 --> 00:38:05,866
<font color="white">Yet each time I watched myself</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">crumble so helplessly,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

461
00:38:06,450 --> 00:38:09,912
<font color="white">I thought that until the day I die,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I would never defy your wishes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

462
00:38:09,996 --> 00:38:10,955
<font color="white">However,</font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:38:11,580 --> 00:38:12,540
<font color="white">this wager?</font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:38:17,461 --> 00:38:19,588
<font color="white">I mean to see it through no matter what.</font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:39:48,344 --> 00:39:49,762
<font color="white">Wait here.</font><font color="white"></font>

466
00:39:50,971 --> 00:39:51,806
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

467
00:40:09,407 --> 00:40:10,241
<font color="white">Miss Yun?</font><font color="white"></font>

468
00:40:15,996 --> 00:40:17,957
<font color="white">Miss Yun, is that really you?</font><font color="white"></font>

469
00:40:26,382 --> 00:40:28,384
<font color="white">How long has it been?</font><font color="white"></font>

470
00:40:30,052 --> 00:40:31,303
<font color="white">It has been a long while,</font><font color="white"></font>

471
00:40:32,763 --> 00:40:33,764
<font color="white">Mrs. Asan.</font><font color="white"></font>

472
00:41:33,282 --> 00:41:34,116
<font color="white">Lady An.</font><font color="white"></font>

473
00:41:41,207 --> 00:41:42,625
<font color="white">It is you, isn't it?</font><font color="white"></font>

474
00:41:48,130 --> 00:41:50,216
<font color="white">I never thought I should see you again.</font><font color="white"></font>

475
00:41:57,097 --> 00:41:59,058
<font color="white">So this is where you have been.</font><font color="white"></font>

476
00:42:06,774 --> 00:42:09,193
<font color="white">How could you be so reckless?</font><font color="white"></font>

477
00:42:11,820 --> 00:42:13,113
<font color="white">I am deeply ashamed.</font><font color="white"></font>

478
00:42:13,614 --> 00:42:16,867
<font color="white">You could have told me at least.</font><font color="white"></font>

479
00:42:18,118 --> 00:42:19,328
<font color="white">I believed</font><font color="white"></font>

480
00:42:20,246 --> 00:42:23,249
<font color="white">you had gone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">without so much as a farewell.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

481
00:42:23,332 --> 00:42:26,877
<font color="white">How are my mother- and father-in-law?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Are they in good health?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

482
00:42:28,837 --> 00:42:31,382
<font color="white">In Bukchon, everyone believes</font><font color="white"></font>

483
00:42:32,341 --> 00:42:33,926
<font color="white">you took your own life.</font><font color="white"></font>

484
00:42:34,969 --> 00:42:37,304
<font color="white">You can never return now.</font><font color="white"></font>

485
00:42:38,055 --> 00:42:39,723
<font color="white">What is done cannot be undone.</font><font color="white"></font>

486
00:42:40,516 --> 00:42:43,435
<font color="white">What on earth did you intend by all this?</font><font color="white"></font>

487
00:42:48,107 --> 00:42:49,108
<font color="white">Was it my cousin</font><font color="white"></font>

488
00:42:50,276 --> 00:42:52,194
<font color="white">who brought you here?</font><font color="white"></font>

489
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:55,030
<font color="white">It was my own choice.</font><font color="white"></font>

490
00:42:56,532 --> 00:42:58,075
<font color="white">I chose to follow him here.</font><font color="white"></font>

491
00:42:59,410 --> 00:43:00,411
<font color="white">Even if only for a while,</font><font color="white"></font>

492
00:43:01,870 --> 00:43:04,540
<font color="white">I wished to remain by his side</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as nothing more than</font><font color="white"></font></font>

493
00:43:06,125 --> 00:43:07,960
<font color="white">an ordinary woman.</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:43:34,320 --> 00:43:35,904
<font color="white">I envy you.</font><font color="white"></font>

495
00:43:40,159 --> 00:43:41,660
<font color="white">I truly…</font><font color="white"></font>

496
00:43:45,372 --> 00:43:47,416
<font color="white">wished to be like you.</font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:43:53,005 --> 00:43:53,881
<font color="white">I…</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:43:58,927 --> 00:44:01,013
<font color="white">wished I could be another An Hui-yeon.</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:44:18,405 --> 00:44:22,201
<font color="white">As a child,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I learned proper script from my father.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

500
00:44:22,951 --> 00:44:25,996
<font color="white">Thanks to that,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I can make it look proper enough.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

501
00:44:31,210 --> 00:44:33,879
<font color="white">WE RESPECTFULLY SUBMIT THIS PROPOSAL</font><font color="white"></font>

502
00:44:33,962 --> 00:44:35,589
<font color="white">What is that?</font><font color="white"></font>

503
00:44:41,553 --> 00:44:44,139
<font color="white">"The son, Won of the Cheongyu Cho clan,</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:44:45,140 --> 00:44:47,393
<font color="white">humbly seeks a marriage match</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:44:47,935 --> 00:44:50,145
<font color="white">with your esteemed daughter, Hui-yeon."</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:44:51,230 --> 00:44:52,856
<font color="white">"We respectfully submit this proposal</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:44:53,774 --> 00:44:56,902
<font color="white">and await your gracious consent."</font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:45:05,702 --> 00:45:07,579
<font color="white">I am but his cousin,</font><font color="white"></font>

509
00:45:08,831 --> 00:45:10,457
<font color="white">so I have no true right to this.</font><font color="white"></font>

510
00:45:15,587 --> 00:45:16,922
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

511
00:45:18,757 --> 00:45:19,967
<font color="white">You said you wished</font><font color="white"></font>

512
00:45:21,009 --> 00:45:24,930
<font color="white">to be with my cousin as an ordinary woman,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">even just for a moment.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

513
00:45:27,558 --> 00:45:28,725
<font color="white">Then do so.</font><font color="white"></font>

514
00:45:29,935 --> 00:45:30,769
<font color="white">And…</font><font color="white"></font>

515
00:45:33,689 --> 00:45:35,566
<font color="white">leave with honor.</font><font color="white"></font>

516
00:45:38,694 --> 00:45:42,197
<font color="white">You must follow the fate laid upon you.</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:45:43,490 --> 00:45:44,533
<font color="white">That is the only way</font><font color="white"></font>

518
00:45:44,616 --> 00:45:48,996
<font color="white">to uphold the dignity of a woman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who shall never be called by her own name</font><font color="white"></font></font>

519
00:45:49,746 --> 00:45:51,206
<font color="white">until the very end.</font><font color="white"></font>

520
00:45:52,291 --> 00:45:53,542
<font color="white">All of this</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:45:54,626 --> 00:45:56,128
<font color="white">is for your sake.</font><font color="white"></font>

522
00:46:24,948 --> 00:46:26,074
<font color="white">I know.</font><font color="white"></font>

523
00:46:31,955 --> 00:46:34,166
<font color="white">Though I can no longer call it honorable…</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:46:38,378 --> 00:46:40,964
<font color="white">I suppose I must</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">atone through death in the end.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

525
00:46:46,553 --> 00:46:48,013
<font color="white">I have one request.</font><font color="white"></font>

526
00:46:48,597 --> 00:46:49,848
<font color="white">Anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

527
00:46:49,932 --> 00:46:53,644
<font color="white">The letters I exchanged with the lord</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">remain somewhere in my quarters.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

528
00:46:53,727 --> 00:46:55,395
<font color="white">I ought to have burned them long ago,</font><font color="white"></font>

529
00:46:55,479 --> 00:46:57,981
<font color="white">yet I could not bring myself to do it</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and left them there.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

530
00:47:01,527 --> 00:47:02,819
<font color="white">I only wished…</font><font color="white"></font>

531
00:47:05,572 --> 00:47:07,741
<font color="white">to yearn for him a little longer.</font><font color="white"></font>

532
00:47:12,538 --> 00:47:13,830
<font color="white">Do not worry.</font><font color="white"></font>

533
00:47:17,417 --> 00:47:20,337
<font color="white">I shall see to everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

534
00:47:30,264 --> 00:47:31,598
<font color="white">You should simply</font><font color="white"></font>

535
00:47:33,141 --> 00:47:35,852
<font color="white">spend the rest of your days</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">by my cousin's side</font><font color="white"></font></font>

536
00:47:37,688 --> 00:47:40,232
<font color="white">and make this</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the most tender ending of your life…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

537
00:47:42,985 --> 00:47:44,987
<font color="white">with no regrets left behind.</font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:47:47,239 --> 00:47:48,657
<font color="white">Do that.</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:48:08,969 --> 00:48:09,886
<font color="white">Young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

540
00:48:11,179 --> 00:48:12,806
<font color="white">You are late.</font><font color="white"></font>

541
00:48:12,889 --> 00:48:15,892
<font color="white">Has my cousin left?</font><font color="white"></font>

542
00:48:15,976 --> 00:48:18,395
<font color="white">Yes, she has.</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:48:18,979 --> 00:48:22,232
<font color="white">She spoke to the guest</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the outer room before departing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

544
00:48:53,555 --> 00:48:55,682
<font color="white">Lady Cho wrote this for us.</font><font color="white"></font>

545
00:49:19,456 --> 00:49:21,291
<font color="white">I wish to remain by your side, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

546
00:49:39,768 --> 00:49:41,186
<font color="white">"I care not if they point fingers</font><font color="white"></font>

547
00:49:42,145 --> 00:49:44,189
<font color="white">and say we have defied Heaven's order."</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:49:44,856 --> 00:49:46,400
<font color="white">Just say that to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

549
00:49:52,447 --> 00:49:54,491
<font color="white">I, too, wish to remain by your side.</font><font color="white"></font>

550
00:50:04,876 --> 00:50:06,044
<font color="white">I care not.</font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:53:51,603 --> 00:53:56,608
<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song</font><font color="white"></font>

